1
00:01:37,870 --> 00:01:42,979
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,050 --> 00:01:43,700
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:45,910
[Episode 30]

4
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,350
The two of us

5
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:49,770
are more than enough to deal with you.

6
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:53,070
How laughable.

7
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:26,400
Twin-Sword Yan Cheng,

8
00:02:26,710 --> 00:02:27,590
you'll

9
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,710
have to find a new title today.

10
00:02:39,210 --> 00:02:40,000
Yan.

11
00:02:48,370 --> 00:02:49,480
Is that so?

12
00:02:53,430 --> 00:02:54,480
Hang in there.

13
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,890
Who says you can't wield two swords

14
00:03:19,079 --> 00:03:21,230
with only one arm?

15
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,520
Yan!

16
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:02,680
Yan!

17
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,880
You old witch,

18
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:06,200
whatever tricks you have left,

19
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,400
bring them on!

20
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:08,870
Come on!

21
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,470
Come on!

22
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,970
Don't talk.

23
00:04:17,269 --> 00:04:18,269
Your Highness...

24
00:04:19,829 --> 00:04:21,430
I've been in plenty of fights

25
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:23,220
in my life.

26
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,510
But today's battle...

27
00:04:27,620 --> 00:04:29,680
is the most exhilarating of them all.

28
00:04:34,150 --> 00:04:35,120
Don't talk.

29
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:37,000
Don't talk anymore.

30
00:04:37,830 --> 00:04:38,800
This is as far...

31
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,360
as I can help you.

32
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:46,070
Yan!

33
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,360
Qingyang...

34
00:05:00,190 --> 00:05:01,000
Qingyang.

35
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:16,360
Once a member
of the Divine Constable Bureau...

36
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:22,520
Always a member
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

37
00:05:47,830 --> 00:05:50,310
Yan!

38
00:05:53,490 --> 00:05:54,570
How foolish.

39
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:58,000
What good is it to throw yourself

40
00:05:58,020 --> 00:05:59,640
against an unbeatable foe?

41
00:06:07,130 --> 00:06:09,060
Your country was but a speck of land

42
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:12,160
surviving by crooked means.

43
00:06:13,950 --> 00:06:17,610
Of course, you wouldn't understand
the backbone of our Great Shi.

44
00:06:17,710 --> 00:06:19,970
To hunt down criminals and root out evil,

45
00:06:20,780 --> 00:06:23,180
to defend the realm
and protect its people—

46
00:06:23,830 --> 00:06:26,190
these are the solemn vows
that my fellow constables

47
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:27,270
and I

48
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:30,510
made to Great Shi

49
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:32,510
and its people.

50
00:06:32,500 --> 00:06:36,580
[Chief Constable's Hall]

51
00:06:35,510 --> 00:06:37,770
Everyone in the Divine Constable Bureau

52
00:06:38,390 --> 00:06:40,280
has long been prepared to die.

53
00:06:43,750 --> 00:06:45,950
Even if we fight to the last person,

54
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:49,150
even if we shed our final drop of blood...

55
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:53,540
[Tianshu Pavilion]

56
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,390
we will never back down.

57
00:06:55,270 --> 00:06:58,400
Having joined
the Divine Constable Bureau in this life,

58
00:06:59,870 --> 00:07:01,200
I shall have no regrets,

59
00:07:02,270 --> 00:07:03,480
even in death.

60
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:50,159
Heaven bless our Great Shi!

61
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,800
Charge!

62
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:26,560
Guili Formation?

63
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,200
So you've been stalling

64
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,120
for time all along.

65
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,789
Isn't it a bit too late

66
00:08:40,470 --> 00:08:42,140
to realize that now?

67
00:08:53,270 --> 00:08:54,120
Yan,

68
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,340
don't go too far ahead.

69
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:59,860
Wait for me.
I'll bring good news of our victory.

70
00:10:11,660 --> 00:10:12,340
[Chief Constable's Hall]

71
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,200
Where is Zhou Yan?

72
00:10:54,970 --> 00:10:56,510
Xuanyuan Shan,

73
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,440
today I will make every last one of you

74
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,080
pay with your lives

75
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,780
and bring down the Great Shi Dynasty!

76
00:11:08,340 --> 00:11:08,880
[Chief Constable's Hall]

77
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:22,080
We mustn't let her
enter the Tianshu Pavilion!

78
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,390
Chief!

79
00:11:36,130 --> 00:11:37,210
Chief!

80
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,270
Chief.

81
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:44,540
The greatest fighter in Great Shi

82
00:11:45,030 --> 00:11:46,910
is nothing special after all.

83
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:55,910
You're at death's door.

84
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,910
Why act so tough?

85
00:12:03,980 --> 00:12:04,380
[Divine Constable Bureau]

86
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:08,880
[Divine Constable Bureau]

87
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,700
[Divine Constable Bureau]

88
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,440
Qiangong Linglong,

89
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:22,120
the Divine Constable Bureau
of our Great Shi

90
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,200
has never been a place

91
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,480
where you can run amok.

92
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:25,870
All of Great Shi

93
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:28,150
is already in my grasp,

94
00:12:28,150 --> 00:12:31,170
[Divine Constable Bureau]

95
00:12:28,550 --> 00:12:31,270
let alone a mere Divine Constable Bureau.

96
00:12:31,630 --> 00:12:33,600
Better to storm
the palace of the King of Hell

97
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,870
than set foot in
the Divine Constable Bureau.

98
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:36,720
Today,

99
00:12:36,910 --> 00:12:38,720
you're not leaving here alive.

100
00:12:43,630 --> 00:12:44,480
Zhou Yan,

101
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,590
open your eyes and look.

102
00:12:46,940 --> 00:12:49,400
[Divine Constable Bureau]

103
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:50,720
I've wiped out
the entire Divine Constable Bureau.

104
00:12:50,850 --> 00:12:52,780
And what can you do all by yourself?

105
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,700
We of the Divine Constable Bureau

106
00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:56,910
have never fought alone.

107
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,080
Behind us,

108
00:12:58,630 --> 00:13:00,200
there will always be

109
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:01,860
comrades and friends.

110
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,090
Qiangong Linglong,

111
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:05,910
you've lost!

112
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,150
Impossible!

113
00:13:31,390 --> 00:13:33,120
I will not lose!

114
00:13:38,420 --> 00:13:40,140
You worthless wretches,

115
00:13:40,170 --> 00:13:41,870
even if there were
another 10 or 100 of you,

116
00:13:41,870 --> 00:13:43,070
I wouldn't be afraid!

117
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:45,120
Come at me, all of you!

118
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:21,270
Can a broken Heaven-Measuring Ruler

119
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:23,310
still fathom the secrets of Heaven?

120
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:25,790
How ridiculous.

121
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:28,060
Though the ruler is broken,

122
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:31,270
with myself as the core of the formation

123
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:34,080
and the Four Divine Beasts
as its framework,

124
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,510
I can still gauge

125
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:37,310
the flow of energy in all things.

126
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,540
Qiangong Linglong,

127
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:48,830
today

128
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:51,190
I shall use your blood

129
00:14:51,220 --> 00:14:52,970
as an offering to my father,

130
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:56,500
my fallen colleagues
in the Divine Constable Bureau,

131
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:57,370
and

132
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,840
the countless innocent people
of our Great Shi

133
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,270
who died unjustly.

134
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,900
Look closely!

135
00:15:22,990 --> 00:15:24,000
This ruler

136
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:26,210
can measure Heaven and Earth,

137
00:15:26,630 --> 00:15:27,960
weigh human hearts,

138
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,510
and uphold justice!

139
00:16:21,250 --> 00:16:23,270
[Divine Constable Bureau]

140
00:16:51,550 --> 00:16:53,040
Zhou Yan!

141
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:42,900
You...

142
00:18:06,310 --> 00:18:09,770
[Divine Constable Bureau]

143
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,160
Impossible...

144
00:18:19,350 --> 00:18:20,630
Impossible!

145
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,370
Impossible...

146
00:18:22,590 --> 00:18:24,300
Impossible...

147
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:27,400
I am the Holy Queen of Liluo.

148
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:28,920
In heaven

149
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,480
and on earth,

150
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,680
I reign supreme.

151
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:36,300
How could I possibly lose?

152
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:48,790
Zhou Yan,

153
00:18:49,550 --> 00:18:52,280
when the Chiying Bug Venom
in your body flares up,

154
00:18:52,550 --> 00:18:54,310
you won't live either!

155
00:19:12,970 --> 00:19:15,120
[Divine Constable Bureau]

156
00:20:16,510 --> 00:20:17,370
Chief!

157
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:20,480
Chief!

158
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:22,870
[Divine Constable Bureau]

159
00:20:22,350 --> 00:20:23,680
We did it!

160
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:25,320
-Great Shi is saved.
-Chief.

161
00:20:26,030 --> 00:20:26,920
Chief.

162
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:30,200
Chief.

163
00:20:32,030 --> 00:20:33,160
How is she, Zhenzhu?

164
00:20:37,510 --> 00:20:38,310
Zhenzhu.

165
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:40,270
How is she, Zhenzhu?

166
00:20:51,070 --> 00:20:54,350
I once promised your father

167
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:56,310
that I would keep you safe.

168
00:20:57,680 --> 00:20:59,550
I've kept my word.

169
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:07,310
I also promised His Majesty

170
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:11,160
that I would keep Great Shi safe.

171
00:21:11,790 --> 00:21:13,400
I've kept that promise too.

172
00:21:20,350 --> 00:21:21,680
But I failed...

173
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:25,070
to protect

174
00:21:26,750 --> 00:21:30,850
the rest of my people
in the Divine Constable Bureau.

175
00:21:31,460 --> 00:21:32,260
Chief.

176
00:21:39,070 --> 00:21:40,960
Yan...

177
00:21:41,790 --> 00:21:42,590
I'm here.

178
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:45,940
Yan...

179
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:47,720
I'm here.

180
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:50,960
Call me "Aunt" one more time.

181
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:55,440
Aunt.

182
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:04,350
I know what you're like.

183
00:22:05,270 --> 00:22:08,960
You love to roam free

184
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:11,590
and hate being restrained.

185
00:22:13,030 --> 00:22:14,310
But you...

186
00:22:16,550 --> 00:22:20,400
must... must promise me

187
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:26,570
that you'll keep
the Divine Constable Bureau alive.

188
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:31,310
I promise.

189
00:22:35,550 --> 00:22:37,000
-Chief.
-Aunt.

190
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:37,790
Chief.

191
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:39,880
Chief...

192
00:23:04,540 --> 00:23:05,020
[Chief's Tally]

193
00:23:06,750 --> 00:23:08,550
Give this Chief's Tally

194
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:13,030
to Prince Ping.

195
00:23:13,700 --> 00:23:16,490
[Chief's Tally]

196
00:23:14,030 --> 00:23:15,270
Tell him...

197
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:22,960
I've fulfilled my duty...
and remained loyal to the very end.

198
00:23:32,590 --> 00:23:34,190
The Divine Constable Bureau

199
00:23:35,590 --> 00:23:37,240
must not fall apart.

200
00:23:39,640 --> 00:23:40,440
Aunt,

201
00:23:41,750 --> 00:23:42,750
don't worry.

202
00:23:43,920 --> 00:23:45,520
The Divine Constable Bureau

203
00:23:47,030 --> 00:23:48,830
will forever remain Great Shi's

204
00:23:49,350 --> 00:23:51,200
strongest shield.

205
00:24:00,660 --> 00:24:03,010
As long as we stand...

206
00:24:07,350 --> 00:24:08,790
The Bureau stands.

207
00:24:12,590 --> 00:24:17,640
Having joined
the Divine Constable Bureau in this life,

208
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:22,640
I shall have no regrets,

209
00:24:28,610 --> 00:24:33,680
even in death.

210
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:37,160
Chief!

211
00:24:37,590 --> 00:24:38,400
Chief!

212
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:41,920
Chief!

213
00:24:42,310 --> 00:24:44,550
Chief!

214
00:24:50,110 --> 00:24:51,920
Chief!

215
00:25:05,350 --> 00:25:06,160
Li Si!

216
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:07,510
Li Si!

217
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:26,030
Zhenzhu,

218
00:25:26,790 --> 00:25:28,000
listen carefully.

219
00:25:28,720 --> 00:25:29,680
You must

220
00:25:30,310 --> 00:25:32,220
fulfill the Chief's last wish.

221
00:25:32,830 --> 00:25:35,860
♪ Capture my heart ♪

222
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:35,720
And

223
00:25:36,390 --> 00:25:39,620
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

224
00:25:36,480 --> 00:25:39,030
the Grand Secretary
has hidden the late Emperor's final edict

225
00:25:39,030 --> 00:25:41,400
behind the plaque in Fengbo Hall.

226
00:25:40,640 --> 00:25:46,040
♪ Can we relive the mark
you once carved deep? ♪

227
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:43,330
My third brother

228
00:25:43,640 --> 00:25:45,240
is the rightful new emperor.

229
00:25:46,160 --> 00:25:47,240
Remember?

230
00:25:46,600 --> 00:25:49,630
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

231
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:49,030
I remember.

232
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:51,030
I remember.

233
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:53,430
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

234
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:53,240
Li Si!

235
00:25:53,310 --> 00:25:54,110
Li Si.

236
00:25:54,130 --> 00:25:55,110
-Li Si!
-Li Si!

237
00:25:54,710 --> 00:26:00,650
♪ In a moment, I fell,
a lifetime left to heal ♪

238
00:26:01,020 --> 00:26:04,080
♪ Tossing and turning
through endless nights ♪

239
00:26:04,900 --> 00:26:07,850
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

240
00:26:08,670 --> 00:26:14,290
♪ Will we meet again,
those I dare not face? ♪

241
00:26:14,990 --> 00:26:17,960
♪ One thought to ferry me
across the sea of suffering ♪

242
00:26:17,510 --> 00:26:18,310
Zhenzhu!

243
00:26:18,740 --> 00:26:21,740
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

244
00:26:20,830 --> 00:26:21,640
Li Si!

245
00:26:23,100 --> 00:26:28,980
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough,
till all turn to dust ♪

246
00:26:29,270 --> 00:26:32,340
♪ Dare not forget ♪

247
00:26:33,090 --> 00:26:36,270
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

248
00:26:37,340 --> 00:26:43,330
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

249
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:38,790
Meng Rui,

250
00:26:39,350 --> 00:26:40,590
what are you doing?

251
00:26:42,240 --> 00:26:43,110
Don't talk!

252
00:26:43,790 --> 00:26:44,680
I've...

253
00:26:44,070 --> 00:26:47,220
♪ Dare not think ♪

254
00:26:45,310 --> 00:26:46,110
I've figured out

255
00:26:46,110 --> 00:26:47,510
the secret of the Ode to Canglang.

256
00:26:47,510 --> 00:26:50,440
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

257
00:26:49,030 --> 00:26:50,160
Then

258
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:52,070
you should know

259
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:56,850
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

260
00:26:52,750 --> 00:26:54,030
that if you save me,

261
00:26:54,830 --> 00:26:56,350
you will die!

262
00:26:57,270 --> 00:27:00,270
♪ Dare not speak too soon ♪

263
00:27:00,960 --> 00:27:03,960
♪ Torn apart inside ♪

264
00:27:04,690 --> 00:27:10,530
♪ Only in love can we escape
withering away ♪

265
00:27:09,680 --> 00:27:10,510
Meng Rui!

266
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:12,350
Stop!

267
00:27:11,610 --> 00:27:14,440
♪ I turn a blind eye ♪

268
00:27:13,270 --> 00:27:14,550
Stop it now!

269
00:27:15,030 --> 00:27:17,960
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

270
00:27:18,980 --> 00:27:25,510
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

271
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:32,320
♪ Forever within your shadow
by your side ♪

272
00:27:34,280 --> 00:27:36,390
[Three days later]

273
00:27:35,600 --> 00:27:39,980
♪ Forever within your shadow
by your side ♪

274
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:40,250
[Prince Ping Zhou Zhu ascended the throne
as Emperor Ming]

275
00:27:56,270 --> 00:27:57,070
Qingyang?

276
00:27:58,440 --> 00:27:59,240
Qingyang!

277
00:28:00,920 --> 00:28:01,720
Yan...

278
00:28:02,840 --> 00:28:03,840
Li Qingyang,

279
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:05,830
no sleeping in!

280
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:08,920
Yan...

281
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:09,680
Li Si.

282
00:28:10,350 --> 00:28:11,960
-I'm here. I'm here.
-Yan...

283
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:12,750
Qingyang.

284
00:28:13,920 --> 00:28:15,000
Qingyang, wake up.

285
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:15,920
Yan.

286
00:28:26,140 --> 00:28:27,690
I dreamed of Yan.

287
00:28:42,550 --> 00:28:43,350
Meng Rui...

288
00:28:45,030 --> 00:28:46,440
How is Meng Rui?

289
00:28:47,350 --> 00:28:48,610
He hasn't woken up yet.

290
00:28:49,270 --> 00:28:50,870
What about his martial arts?

291
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:31,880
What about the Chief?

292
00:29:33,510 --> 00:29:34,830
And everyone else?

293
00:29:38,270 --> 00:29:40,530
What about the Divine Constable Bureau?

294
00:29:44,270 --> 00:29:45,070
Zhenzhu.

295
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:48,510
Tell me.

296
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:02,600
I need to go to
the Divine Constable Bureau.

297
00:30:05,080 --> 00:30:06,780
Li Si, be good.

298
00:30:06,880 --> 00:30:08,610
Rest first, okay?

299
00:30:08,720 --> 00:30:09,510
Li Si.

300
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:10,770
Li Si.

301
00:30:12,750 --> 00:30:14,850
Let me help you up, okay?

302
00:30:14,870 --> 00:30:17,270
I need to go to
the Divine Constable Bureau.

303
00:30:18,210 --> 00:30:19,390
Li Si!

304
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:23,880
Li Si!

305
00:32:03,790 --> 00:32:04,870
My comrades...

306
00:32:08,160 --> 00:32:10,070
you will not have died in vain.

307
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:24,350
Fortunately,
the people throughout the realm

308
00:32:24,350 --> 00:32:27,000
suffered no harm
when Liluo wreaked havoc.

309
00:32:26,140 --> 00:32:31,050
[List of the Fallen
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

310
00:32:27,480 --> 00:32:29,920
The households
of the realm remained at peace,

311
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:32,510
and the armies stayed in good order,

312
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:34,680
without losing a single soldier.

313
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:37,680
We have carefully
documented the casualties

314
00:32:35,490 --> 00:32:39,530
[List of the Fallen
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

315
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:40,880
and submitted them
to the relevant office for filing.

316
00:32:43,070 --> 00:32:43,880
Summon

317
00:32:44,240 --> 00:32:46,750
His Highness Prince Xian for an audience!

318
00:32:46,230 --> 00:32:50,170
[Xuanyuan Shan]

319
00:33:17,480 --> 00:33:18,810
Your subject, Zhou Yan,

320
00:33:19,640 --> 00:33:21,570
pays his respects to Your Majesty.

321
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:32,200
No need for such formalities.

322
00:33:32,200 --> 00:33:33,130
Fourth Brother,

323
00:33:33,840 --> 00:33:36,520
although we're sovereign and subject now,

324
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:39,940
we're still brothers bound by blood.

325
00:33:41,350 --> 00:33:42,750
Actually, in my heart,

326
00:33:43,550 --> 00:33:45,550
-you should've been...
-I wouldn't

327
00:33:45,680 --> 00:33:47,160
dare presume, Brother.

328
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:51,170
If I truly had such intentions,

329
00:33:51,350 --> 00:33:52,160
I would

330
00:33:52,590 --> 00:33:53,510
never have told Father

331
00:33:53,510 --> 00:33:54,680
about my condition

332
00:33:55,030 --> 00:33:56,200
back then.

333
00:33:56,590 --> 00:33:57,400
Truth be told,

334
00:33:57,400 --> 00:33:58,790
the days of riding along the frontier

335
00:33:58,790 --> 00:34:00,270
and fighting bloody battles

336
00:34:00,270 --> 00:34:01,640
felt easier to me.

337
00:34:01,640 --> 00:34:02,920
The burden of this vast realm

338
00:34:02,920 --> 00:34:03,880
is too heavy.

339
00:34:04,750 --> 00:34:06,110
With my temperament,

340
00:34:06,480 --> 00:34:08,030
I simply couldn't
force myself to take it on.

341
00:34:08,030 --> 00:34:08,920
Only you, Brother,

342
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:11,150
can bring lasting stability to the country

343
00:34:11,150 --> 00:34:12,920
and allow its people
to live in peace and prosperity.

344
00:34:12,920 --> 00:34:15,120
You were poisoned by Chiying Bug Venom,

345
00:34:16,150 --> 00:34:17,350
yet you hid it from me.

346
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:20,360
That amounts to deceiving the sovereign.

347
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:21,630
How is your health now?

348
00:34:24,230 --> 00:34:25,360
By Heaven's grace,

349
00:34:26,190 --> 00:34:27,710
I've made a full recovery.

350
00:34:28,150 --> 00:34:29,840
If anything had happened to you,

351
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:31,900
how could I ever have sat on the throne

352
00:34:32,070 --> 00:34:33,150
in peace?

353
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:36,670
At least we're still alive.

354
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:39,670
But some people...

355
00:34:50,550 --> 00:34:52,010
They're no longer with us.

356
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:01,170
[Chief's Tally]

357
00:35:11,100 --> 00:35:13,690
[List of the Fallen
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

358
00:35:15,550 --> 00:35:16,360
Brother.

359
00:35:18,550 --> 00:35:20,010
You must have already seen

360
00:35:20,590 --> 00:35:21,880
the list submitted by

361
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:23,400
the Divine Constable Bureau.

362
00:35:23,400 --> 00:35:25,440
Those 112 people—

363
00:35:25,710 --> 00:35:27,910
it was they who defended Tianhuang City

364
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:30,600
and protected this country.

365
00:35:31,360 --> 00:35:32,290
Fourth Brother,

366
00:35:33,920 --> 00:35:35,220
for the past 17 years,

367
00:35:35,310 --> 00:35:37,040
you've been in this game alone.

368
00:35:39,150 --> 00:35:40,550
You've kept your distance

369
00:35:40,550 --> 00:35:42,230
from those close to you,

370
00:35:42,800 --> 00:35:44,730
never enjoying the love of parents

371
00:35:45,360 --> 00:35:47,020
or the bond between siblings.

372
00:35:48,590 --> 00:35:49,960
As a pawn,

373
00:35:51,710 --> 00:35:53,510
you've devoted your entire life

374
00:35:54,070 --> 00:35:55,510
to the country.

375
00:35:56,150 --> 00:35:57,500
Fortunately,

376
00:35:59,360 --> 00:36:00,820
the country still stands,

377
00:36:02,880 --> 00:36:04,410
and its people remain safe.

378
00:36:05,030 --> 00:36:06,030
Even now,

379
00:36:06,030 --> 00:36:07,960
the realm is all you ever think about.

380
00:36:07,960 --> 00:36:10,220
You have never once asked me for anything

381
00:36:10,550 --> 00:36:11,920
for yourself.

382
00:36:12,590 --> 00:36:13,400
I...

383
00:36:15,800 --> 00:36:17,280
do have a request.

384
00:36:18,840 --> 00:36:21,320
If the Divine Constable Bureau
is to be rebuilt,

385
00:36:21,320 --> 00:36:22,580
I ask that Your Majesty

386
00:36:22,670 --> 00:36:25,030
posthumously honor
the more than 100 heroes

387
00:36:25,030 --> 00:36:26,760
of the Divine Constable Bureau

388
00:36:26,760 --> 00:36:28,960
who shed their blood on the battlefield

389
00:36:29,030 --> 00:36:30,710
and gave their lives to protect the city,

390
00:36:30,710 --> 00:36:32,440
and grant them burials
befitting their sacrifice,

391
00:36:32,440 --> 00:36:34,440
so that their souls may rest in peace

392
00:36:35,000 --> 00:36:36,800
and their loyalty and righteousness

393
00:36:36,800 --> 00:36:39,000
may be remembered throughout the land.

394
00:36:44,360 --> 00:36:45,760
Your request is granted.

395
00:36:46,550 --> 00:36:47,920
The affairs of this empire

396
00:36:47,920 --> 00:36:49,230
and the peace of its people

397
00:36:49,230 --> 00:36:50,670
depend upon the sharp sword

398
00:36:50,670 --> 00:36:51,710
in their hands.

399
00:36:52,840 --> 00:36:54,170
Whatever else you want,

400
00:36:54,440 --> 00:36:55,440
just ask.

401
00:36:56,000 --> 00:36:57,110
I'll grant it all.

402
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:03,620
I implore Your Majesty

403
00:37:04,030 --> 00:37:06,360
to allow
the rebuilt Divine Constable Bureau

404
00:37:06,360 --> 00:37:08,550
not only to hunt down criminals
throughout the realm

405
00:37:08,550 --> 00:37:10,280
but also to open wider channels

406
00:37:10,590 --> 00:37:11,880
for the people's voices,

407
00:37:11,880 --> 00:37:14,030
so that the hardships,

408
00:37:14,190 --> 00:37:15,030
grievances,

409
00:37:15,190 --> 00:37:16,960
and sentiments of the people everywhere

410
00:37:16,960 --> 00:37:18,230
can flow like rivers into the sea,

411
00:37:18,230 --> 00:37:19,710
through the Bureau's

412
00:37:19,800 --> 00:37:21,320
Shangfang Drum,

413
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:23,130
straight to the throne.

414
00:37:24,440 --> 00:37:26,710
This is more than
simply giving the people a voice.

415
00:37:26,710 --> 00:37:27,770
What you truly seek

416
00:37:28,550 --> 00:37:31,350
is an executioner's blade
hanging over the court.

417
00:37:31,360 --> 00:37:32,820
Only by keeping this blade

418
00:37:33,150 --> 00:37:33,960
will the state

419
00:37:34,590 --> 00:37:36,150
stand as firm as a rock

420
00:37:37,150 --> 00:37:38,000
and

421
00:37:38,960 --> 00:37:40,840
the golden age endure.

422
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:54,360
Great Shi has suffered this calamity,

423
00:37:55,880 --> 00:37:57,280
yet it remains standing,

424
00:37:57,800 --> 00:38:00,630
all thanks to you
and the Divine Constable Bureau.

425
00:38:05,360 --> 00:38:07,490
Prince Xian Zhou Yan, hear the decree.

426
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:08,670
Yes, Your Majesty.

427
00:38:08,670 --> 00:38:09,880
From today onward,

428
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,480
you shall assume the position
of Chief of the Divine Constable Bureau.

429
00:38:11,480 --> 00:38:13,070
While carrying on
the legacy of our fallen heroes,

430
00:38:13,070 --> 00:38:15,630
you shall oversee
the burial of those lost in battle.

431
00:38:15,630 --> 00:38:17,000
Your authority

432
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:18,280
shall extend across all regions.

433
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:19,920
Whenever you encounter
any corrupt official who harms the realm,

434
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:21,960
you may execute them first
and report later.

435
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:24,590
I further grant you the privilege
of entering court without hurrying,

436
00:38:24,590 --> 00:38:26,360
being addressed
by title instead of by name,

437
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:27,760
and wearing your sword in the palace hall.

438
00:38:27,760 --> 00:38:28,960
Your Majesty is wise.

439
00:38:29,280 --> 00:38:31,550
I accept the decree.

440
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:40,260
From this day forward,

441
00:38:40,400 --> 00:38:41,480
I will be at court,

442
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:42,740
and you in the jianghu.

443
00:38:42,840 --> 00:38:43,920
Together, we shall safeguard

444
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:45,760
the realm, each in our own sphere.

445
00:38:45,760 --> 00:38:48,220
If one day I become
a foolish and inept ruler,

446
00:38:49,320 --> 00:38:53,050
you may use the Heaven-Measuring Ruler
to knock some sense into me.

447
00:38:59,320 --> 00:39:01,740
[Chief's Tally]

448
00:39:11,920 --> 00:39:14,690
[Chief's Tally]

449
00:39:19,260 --> 00:39:21,660
[Chief's Tally]

450
00:39:20,550 --> 00:39:22,150
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

451
00:39:22,630 --> 00:39:23,440
From now on,

452
00:39:23,960 --> 00:39:25,550
the Divine Constable Bureau

453
00:39:25,550 --> 00:39:26,510
shall protect

454
00:39:27,150 --> 00:39:29,080
Great Shi alongside Your Majesty.

455
00:40:42,400 --> 00:40:43,510
How much longer

456
00:40:43,590 --> 00:40:45,000
will he lie there like this?

457
00:40:45,000 --> 00:40:46,400
Who knows?

458
00:40:46,550 --> 00:40:47,680
If you say he's dead,

459
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:49,840
his body shows no signs of decay.

460
00:40:49,840 --> 00:40:51,150
If you say he's not dead,

461
00:40:51,150 --> 00:40:52,400
there isn't the slightest

462
00:40:52,400 --> 00:40:53,600
breath of life in him.

463
00:40:54,030 --> 00:40:55,320
I, for one,

464
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:57,150
have never encountered anything like this.

465
00:40:57,150 --> 00:40:58,190
I've tried

466
00:40:58,320 --> 00:40:59,920
everything I could.

467
00:40:59,960 --> 00:41:01,880
The rest is up to Heaven.

468
00:41:07,710 --> 00:41:08,670
I believe

469
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:11,110
he will wake up.

470
00:41:16,550 --> 00:41:18,760
I once saw a fragment
of the Ode to Canglang

471
00:41:18,760 --> 00:41:21,490
in the secret room
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

472
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:23,390
I remember it saying that

473
00:41:23,550 --> 00:41:25,920
reaching its highest level depends on

474
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:28,440
the practitioner's choice:

475
00:41:29,230 --> 00:41:31,840
to follow oneself or to follow others.

476
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:34,280
Following oneself leads to stagnation.

477
00:41:34,280 --> 00:41:36,360
Following others brings life.

478
00:41:37,320 --> 00:41:39,280
This happens to echo a Zen principle:

479
00:41:39,280 --> 00:41:41,440
one must destroy the old
to create the new.

480
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:42,230
Perhaps

481
00:41:43,760 --> 00:41:44,820
the Ode to Canglang

482
00:41:45,590 --> 00:41:48,960
requires the practitioner's cultivation
to be destroyed once

483
00:41:48,960 --> 00:41:51,550
before they can cultivate again,
break through,

484
00:41:51,550 --> 00:41:52,840
and reach perfection.

485
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:55,960
You mean

486
00:41:57,360 --> 00:42:01,150
Meng Rui might have temporarily
stopped his heartbeat and breathing,

487
00:42:01,150 --> 00:42:03,150
entering a state of suspended animation,

488
00:42:03,150 --> 00:42:04,480
thereby enhancing his ability

489
00:42:04,480 --> 00:42:07,080
to circulate and control
his internal energy?

490
00:42:10,190 --> 00:42:11,480
Like a phoenix

491
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:13,220
rising from the ashes.

492
00:42:14,400 --> 00:42:16,360
This is Meng Rui's fate,

493
00:42:17,150 --> 00:42:18,710
and also his tribulation.

494
00:43:24,150 --> 00:43:24,960
Chief,

495
00:43:25,670 --> 00:43:26,960
it's time.

496
00:43:27,280 --> 00:43:28,920
Everyone is waiting for us.

497
00:43:42,390 --> 00:43:44,890
[Seventh Chief Xuanyuan Shan; Moon Deity]

498
00:43:52,450 --> 00:44:01,100
[Chief Constable's Hall]

499
00:44:06,440 --> 00:44:11,510
Spirits of the fallen, return!

500
00:44:18,190 --> 00:44:23,110
Spirits of the fallen, return!

501
00:44:25,710 --> 00:44:30,550
Spirits of the fallen, return!

502
00:44:26,660 --> 00:44:30,160
[Souls Return Home; Stele of the Fallen Heroes
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

503
00:44:33,190 --> 00:44:38,320
Spirits of the fallen, return!

504
00:44:39,320 --> 00:44:45,230
Spirits of the fallen, return!

505
00:44:51,650 --> 00:44:53,260
[Xuanyuan Shan] [Cui Xihai] [Chu Nanzhou]

506
00:44:58,070 --> 00:45:00,630
[Yan Cheng] [Shen Mobai] [Lu Yun]

507
00:45:38,030 --> 00:45:41,000
In the 46 years since its founding,
the Divine Constable Bureau

508
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:42,760
has hunted down criminals,
rooted out evil,

509
00:45:42,760 --> 00:45:44,960
defended the realm,
and protected its people.

510
00:45:44,960 --> 00:45:47,230
We have never asked
whether we would live or die,

511
00:45:47,230 --> 00:45:48,580
only what is right or wrong.

512
00:45:48,580 --> 00:45:55,750
[Souls Return Home; Stele of the Fallen Heroes
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

513
00:46:01,840 --> 00:46:03,260
The late Emperor once said,

514
00:46:03,260 --> 00:46:06,930
[Souls Return Home; Stele of the Fallen Heroes
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

515
00:46:03,630 --> 00:46:05,480
"The Divine Constable Bureau's blades

516
00:46:05,480 --> 00:46:06,800
slay only the wicked,

517
00:46:07,550 --> 00:46:08,840
and its blood

518
00:46:09,550 --> 00:46:11,410
is shed only on the battlefield."

519
00:46:11,960 --> 00:46:13,280
You lived up to it.

520
00:46:14,230 --> 00:46:20,710
[Souls Return Home; Stele of the Fallen Heroes
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

521
00:46:14,360 --> 00:46:15,150
Today,

522
00:46:16,360 --> 00:46:19,020
in honor of the late Emperor's
final teachings,

523
00:46:19,320 --> 00:46:20,280
I toast you all.

524
00:46:37,840 --> 00:46:39,070
The Liluo invaders

525
00:46:39,330 --> 00:46:43,780
[Souls Return Home; Stele of the Fallen Heroes
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

526
00:46:40,190 --> 00:46:42,390
plotted to plunge the realm into chaos.

527
00:46:42,550 --> 00:46:43,920
They sought to slaughter our people

528
00:46:42,560 --> 00:46:45,270
♪ With no desire to gaze at the stars ♪

529
00:46:44,710 --> 00:46:46,260
and lay waste to our homeland.

530
00:46:46,260 --> 00:46:48,980
♪ Dreams may soothe the pain ♪

531
00:46:46,710 --> 00:46:47,710
It was you

532
00:46:48,280 --> 00:46:50,280
who became a wall of flesh and blood,

533
00:46:50,280 --> 00:46:51,710
a shield forged from your own lives,

534
00:46:50,300 --> 00:46:53,120
♪ But they're too easily disturbed ♪

535
00:46:51,850 --> 00:46:57,660
[Souls Return Home; Stele of the Fallen Heroes
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

536
00:46:52,280 --> 00:46:53,590
to defend

537
00:46:53,590 --> 00:46:54,880
every inch of the land

538
00:46:53,740 --> 00:46:55,810
♪ So I'll stand up high on a tower ♪

539
00:46:55,710 --> 00:46:57,110
and every household.

540
00:46:56,370 --> 00:46:58,210
♪ Never looking away ♪

541
00:46:58,550 --> 00:47:00,170
♪ And see how so-called fate ♪

542
00:46:58,630 --> 00:47:00,610
On behalf of the people of Great Shi,

543
00:47:00,610 --> 00:47:02,330
♪ Makes choices for me ♪

544
00:47:02,280 --> 00:47:03,280
I toast you all.

545
00:47:02,640 --> 00:47:04,420
♪ Let the breathtaking ♪

546
00:47:03,520 --> 00:47:07,340
[Souls Return Home; Stele of the Fallen Heroes
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

547
00:47:04,770 --> 00:47:06,310
♪ Take the place of cold, lonely stars ♪

548
00:47:06,610 --> 00:47:08,270
♪ Cutting through the mist ♪

549
00:47:08,600 --> 00:47:10,780
♪ To light up my eyes ♪

550
00:47:10,210 --> 00:47:13,200
[Souls Return Home; Stele of the Fallen Heroes
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

551
00:47:10,970 --> 00:47:13,630
♪ If the moonlight is hidden
and the candles burn out ♪

552
00:47:14,120 --> 00:47:16,170
♪ And I can't see myself ♪

553
00:47:17,630 --> 00:47:18,440
Today,

554
00:47:18,980 --> 00:47:23,310
[Souls Return Home; Stele of the Fallen Heroes
of the Divine Constable Bureau]

555
00:47:19,010 --> 00:47:21,700
♪ I believe
some unseen longing surges within ♪

556
00:47:19,440 --> 00:47:21,000
in my capacity as Chief,

557
00:47:22,000 --> 00:47:25,320
I hereby posthumously honor you all
as Guardian Heroes of the Realm.

558
00:47:22,230 --> 00:47:24,250
♪ Pulling me along ♪

559
00:47:26,030 --> 00:47:27,030
Your blood

560
00:47:27,760 --> 00:47:29,490
will not have been shed in vain.

561
00:47:29,550 --> 00:47:30,510
Your spirits

562
00:47:31,280 --> 00:47:32,880
shall not wander aimlessly!

563
00:47:33,800 --> 00:47:35,880
The spirit of the Divine Constable Bureau

564
00:47:35,880 --> 00:47:38,280
is the very spirit
of the Great Shi Dynasty!

565
00:47:38,590 --> 00:47:40,230
As long as our land endures

566
00:47:40,800 --> 00:47:42,190
and our people remain,

567
